newpath 66 178 moveto 72 214 lineto cb-grassdk cb-rgb << /Width 3 /Depletion 0 >> pkliner
72 214 14 222 16 cb-leafc cb-leaf
/cb-trail 4.5 def
360 92 40 cb-moss
cb-ink cb-rgb
